## Built right, not just built fast

We build WordPress websites using Bricks Builder — a professional-grade builder that's significantly faster and more flexible than the bloated themes and drag-and-drop tools most agencies rely on. It gives us full control over the code output, meaning leaner markup, quicker load times, and none of the unnecessary baggage that slows most WordPress sites down.

The result is a site that scores well in Google's Core Web Vitals, loads fast on mobile, and is easy for you to manage and update yourself.

Speed matters for SEO. A slow site loses rankings and loses customers. We build with performance baked in from the start.

## Our development process

1. **Handover** — We receive the approved design and plan the build
2. **Development** — Clean, semantic code built to spec
3. **Testing** — Cross-browser and device testing before launch
4. **Launch** — Deployment, DNS setup, SSL, and performance checks
5. **Support** — Ongoing [maintenance packages](/services/website-maintenance-packages/) available after launch

## What's included in every build

Every site we develop ships with on-page SEO set up correctly — meta titles, descriptions, heading structure, image alt text, and schema markup where relevant. We also configure [fast managed hosting](/services/website-hosting-security/) with SSL and daily backups so your site is secure from day one.

